  "question": {
    "text": "The number of solutions of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to."
