  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi></mi></math> or <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></math> (Not possible as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> )<br />Hence, for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;there are&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn></math> solutions in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>"
